    <h1 class="reveal">Why resellers outrank your brand on Google — <em>and what it costs you every month</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub reveal">Your customers search for your products on Google. They find them — on a reseller, a wholesaler or a marketplace. It's neither bad luck nor inevitable: it's a precise mechanism, with four identifiable leaks and a monthly cost you can estimate.</p>
